  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5904.02 Provider License Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5904.02 Provider License Application.\n\n(a) Each applicant for a provider license shall complete and submit “New Hampshire Bureau of EMS Provider License Application” form, https://www.nh.gov/safety/divisions/fstems/documents/providerlicenseapplication.pdf,as revised September 2025.\n\n(b) The application shall be signed and dated by:\n\n(1) The applicant; and\n\n(2) In the case of an apprentice, a parent or legal guardian.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19; ss by #13174, eff 2-24-21; (see also Revision Note at part heading for Saf-C 5904); ss by #14364, eff 9-4-25, EXPIRES: 9-4-35",
